  "description": "Heritage Slab – Bold Retro Western Slab Serif Font\nIntroducing Heritage Slab, a heavy, bold slab serif font with soft rounded corners and a nostalgic vintage charm. Inspired by classic wood-type posters, old-time printing, and Americana signage, this typeface brings strong personality and instant readability to every project.\nHeritage Slab is perfect for creating eye-catching headlines, logos, posters, labels, and merchandise designs. Its chunky letterforms stay clear even at small sizes and look striking when scaled up.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Heritage Slab – Bold Retro Western Slab Serif Font</p>\n<p>Introducing Heritage Slab, a heavy, bold slab serif font with soft rounded corners and a nostalgic vintage charm. Inspired by classic wood-type posters, old-time printing, and Americana signage, this typeface brings strong personality and instant readability to every project.</p>\n<p>Heritage Slab is perfect for creating eye-catching headlines, logos, posters, labels, and merchandise designs. Its chunky letterforms stay clear even at small sizes and look striking when scaled up.</p>",
